{"id":"n26808-2-20","stage":1,"title":"길다 · 长","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26808-2-20-1","ko":"미국으로 유학을 간 민준이는 매년 여름에만 한국에 온대.","zh":"去美国留学的敏俊，每年只有夏天才会回韩国。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"미국으로","meaning":"美国","explanation":"미국：美国；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"미국으로","audio":"/audio/b95ca4008220200fd1bd.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"유학을","meaning":"留学","explanation":"유학：留学；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"유학","audio":"/audio/4c52a19db898d399dde7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70244","senseId":"1","lemma":"유학","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"간","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"민준이는","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"민준이는","audio":"/audio/068c382ba3282b86786d.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"매년","meaning":"每年，年年","explanation":"매년：每年，年年","readings":[{"term":"매년","audio":"/audio/178f93c42278701aa818.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51746","senseId":"1","lemma":"매년","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여름에만","meaning":"夏，夏天，夏季","explanation":"여름：夏，夏天，夏季；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"여름","audio":"/audio/4442e49ca3d7c1ba77c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67701","senseId":"1","lemma":"여름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한국에","meaning":"韩国","explanation":"한국：韩国；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"한국에","audio":"/audio/0668fd72ac3d24742754.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"온대.","meaning":"来，加入","explanation":"오다：来，加入；ㄴ대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"2","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4c52a19db898d3