lemma":"여름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"방학이","meaning":"放假","explanation":"방학：放假；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"방학","audio":"/audio/236457354c2107a38d81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20207","senseId":"1","lemma":"방학","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"길거든.","meaning":"长，久","explanation":"길다：长，久；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"길다","audio":"/audio/013e520a738e476f5fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26808","senseId":"2","lemma":"길다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac9e69428d653c8c","term":"겨울","zh":"冬天，冬季","audio":"/audio/ac9e69428d653c8c2b15.mp3","entryId":"64367","definition":"四季中的一个，介于秋天和春天之间的寒冷的季节。","pronunciation":["겨울"]},{"id":"236457354c2107a3","term":"방학","zh":"放假","audio":"/audio/236457354c2107a38d81.mp3","entryId":"20207","definition":"学校里一个学期结束后在一定期间内停止课业；或那个期间。","pronunciation":["방ː학"]},{"id":"6dab7d40289b180d","term":"짧다","zh":"短","audio":"/audio/6dab7d40289b180d0cb0.mp3","entryId":"71363","definition":"从一个时间到另一个时间相隔不久。","pronunciation":["짤따"]},{"id":"4442e49ca3d7c1ba","term":"여름","zh":"夏，夏天，夏季","audio":"/audio/4442e49ca3d7c1ba77c7.mp3","entryId":"67701","definition":"四季之一，介于春秋之间的季节。","pronunciation":["여름"]},{"id":"013e520a738e476f","term":"길다","zh":"长，久","audio":"/audio/013e520a738e476f5fd9.mp3","entryId":"26808","definition":"从一个时间到另一个时间相隔甚远。","pronunciation":["길ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ad4f633ea3c4c7a2f57f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.46,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=26808","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":39,"sequenceScore":1.8605,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["因为美国的寒假很短，而暑假很长。","去美国留学的敏俊，每年只有夏天才会回韩国。","这些写在这里的东西，你能自己顺利买回来吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["去美国留学的敏俊，每年只有夏天才会回韩国。","这些写在这里的东西，你能自己顺利买回来吗？","因为美国的寒假很短，而暑假很长。"],"answer":2}]}
